  ('ISO27001','a8-134','Sind WLANs in eigene Segmente getrennt, stark verschlüsselt und ist das Gastnetz vom internen Netz isoliert?','Are WLANs separated into own segments, strongly encrypted, and is the guest network isolated from the internal network?','{"coverage": "hub", "iso_ids": ["a8-134"], "risiko_ids": ["R-0058", "R-0060", "R-0137", "R-0138", "R-0141"], "n_risiken": 5}'::jsonb),
